[node name="Report" type="Label" parent="Chalkboard_Content/Chalk_Mask/Case_Report"]
layout_mode = 0
offset_left = 2.0
offset_top = 16.0
offset_right = 574.0
offset_bottom = 274.0
text = "Case: The Vanishing Witness
Case ID: #2024-0457
Status: Open


Summary: Mia Turner, key witness in a criminal case, has gone missing. Last contacted 48 hours ago. She was set to testify against a local gang involved in illegal arms trade.

Objectives:
    Investigate Mia's apartment for clues.
    Interview her friend, Emma Wright, for any leads.
    Check phone records for unusual activity.

Leads:
    Surveillance footage near Mia's apartment.
    Neighbor reported hearing voices the night Mia vanished.
    Anonymous tip suggests Mia may have fled town voluntarily.

Next Steps:
    Visit Mia's apartment.
    Speak with Emma Wright.
    Analyze phone records."
autowrap_mode = 2
metadata/_edit_lock_ = true

